     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1868年5月18日生於皇村；GND 記載其1894至1917年為沙皇，被形容為神授君權的代表與專制君主，1914年下令俄國總動員。1918年7月17日在葉卡捷琳堡去世。",
      "en": "Born on 18 May 1868 at Tsarskoye Selo; the GND record gives him as tsar from 1894 to 1917, an upholder of the divine right of kings and an autocratic sole ruler, and records his 1914 order for Russian general mobilisation. He died on 17 July 1918 at Yekaterinburg."
     },
