     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "生平概略",
      "en": "Life outline"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "自由黨政治人物，1863年1月17日生；1908年出任財政大臣，GND 記載至1915年；1915年任軍需大臣，1916年任戰爭大臣，同年12月接替阿斯奎斯出任首相，GND 記載任至1922年。1945年3月26日去世。",
      "en": "A Liberal politician, born 17 January 1863; he became Chancellor of the Exchequer in 1908 (the GND gives 1908–1915), minister of munitions in 1915 and minister of war in 1916, and succeeded Asquith as prime minister in December 1916 (the GND gives 1916–1922). He died on 26 March 1945."
     },
