      "en": "Life outline"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1869年3月18日生於伯明罕的政治世家；1923年任衛生大臣，1924至1929年再度任此職；1931年重返內閣並出任財政大臣；1937年5月接任首相，1940年辭職，同年11月9日去世。",
      "en": "Born on 18 March 1869 into a politically prominent family in Birmingham; he was minister of health in 1923 and again from 1924 to 1929, rejoined the cabinet in 1931 as Chancellor of the Exchequer, became prime minister in May 1937, resigned in 1940 and died on 9 November that year."
     },
